@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
autonumber
title US02 - View Home (SD)

actor User
participant "HomeFragment" as Home
participant "AlbumApiClient" as Albums
participant "ArtistApiClient" as Artists
participant "PlaylistApiClient" as Playlists
participant "PlayerApiClient" as Player
participant "Spotify Web API" as Spotify

User -> Home: open the Home tab
Home -> Albums: getUserSavedAlbums(token, callback)
Albums -> Spotify: GET /me/albums
Spotify --> Home: saved albums
Home -> Artists: getTopArtists(token, callback)
Artists -> Spotify: GET /me/top/artists
Spotify --> Home: top artists
Home -> Playlists: getCurrentUserPlaylists(token, 50, 0, callback)
Playlists -> Spotify: GET /me/playlists
Spotify --> Home: playlists
Home -> Home: showQuickAccess()
Home -> Player: getRecentlyPlayedTracks(token, callback)
Player -> Spotify: GET /me/player/recently-played
Spotify --> Home: recently played tracks
Home -> Home: showRecents()
Home --> User: show the grid, "Voltar a ouvir" and "Ouvidas recentemente"

@enduml
